 "remarks": "Charming one bedroom, one bath cottage yearly furnished rental in the Old Hill neighborhood of Westport. This stand alone cottage has lovely natural light with hardwood floors, high ceilings & a full kitchen with a breakfast bar. The primary bedroom has a walk in closet & hardwood floors. There is a stackable washer/dryer laundry in the full bath. The deck & additional patio offer lovely outdoor space. The tenant has access to one bay of the garage. The landscaping, snow removal & trash collection are included in the rent. Move right in & enjoy all that Westport has to offer. Available May 1st.",
